; fennec.web — typed server-side building blocks on Paw: server-rendered HTML responses (Handler),
; typed form/query INPUT over the Sift model (Form), typed path/query + JSON-body decode (Action),
; and JSON output building blocks (Respond). It owns NO new model — it projects the SAME Sift shape
; (the one that powers collections + DDP methods) onto HTTP. Native (server-side) only. Standalone
; Standalone HANDLERS (view + load + own bundle) are a Fur concept, not here — see fennec.fur.handler.

(library
 (name fennec_web)
 (public_name fennec.web)
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries fennec-paw fennec.pulse.sift fennec-mongo.bson fennec-mongo.bson_json fennec.fur fennec.fur.form fennec.accounts)
 (inline_tests
  (backend fennec-hunt.runner))
 (preprocess
  (pps fennec-hunt.ppx)))
